## TournamentRegistrationController tests
## Tokens: adminToken=Pulse(admin,TEAM_ALPHA) | managerToken=Lynx(manager TEAM_ALPHA)
## memberWithATeamToken=Rogue(member TEAM_ALPHA, not manager) | memberWithoutATeamToken=user without team
## memberWithoutATeam2=user without team
##
## TEAM_ALPHA initial state: 1 manager (Lynx) + 2 accepted members (Rogue, Pulse) = 3 total
## Min required: 4 → SETUP must add memberWithoutATeam2 to TEAM_ALPHA before the [OK 201] test

## SETUP — skip if already run
### [SETUP] memberWithoutATeam2 joins TEAM_ALPHA
POST {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/1/membership
Authorization: {{memberWithoutATeam2}}

### [SETUP] Lynx accepts the join request (membership id depends on db state — adjust if needed)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/3/accept
Authorization: {{managerToken}}

### [SETUP] Admin creates a PLANIFIED tournament
# @name createOpenTournament
POST {{baseUrl}}/tournaments
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Spring Cup",
  "description": "Tournoi ouvert aux inscriptions",
  "startDate": "2026-06-01",
  "endDate": "2026-06-03",
  "startInscriptionDate": "2026-04-01",
  "endInscriptionDate": "2026-05-31",
  "maxTeams": 4,
  "state": "PLANIFIED"
}

> {%
client.global.set("openTournamentId", response.body.id);
%}

### [SETUP] Admin creates a non-open tournament (IN_PREPARATION)
# @name createClosedTournament
POST {{baseUrl}}/tournaments
Authorization: {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Winter Cup",
  "description": "Tournoi pas encore ouvert",
  "startDate": "2026-12-01",
  "endDate": "2026-12-03",
  "startInscriptionDate": "2026-10-01",
  "endInscriptionDate": "2026-11-30",
  "maxTeams": 4,
  "state": "IN_PREPARATION"
}

> {%
client.global.set("closedTournamentId", response.body.id);
%}

### POST /tournaments/{tournamentId}/registrations — Register a team

### [KO 403] Register — unauthenticated visitor
POST {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/{{openTournamentId}}/registrations

### [KO 400] Register — user has no team
POST {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/{{openTournamentId}}/registrations
Authorization: {{memberWithoutATeamToken}}

### [KO 400] Register — Rogue is a member of TEAM_ALPHA but not its manager
POST {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/{{openTournamentId}}/registrations
Authorization: {{memberWithATeamToken}}

### [KO 404] Register — tournament not found
POST {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/999999/registrations
Authorization: {{managerToken}}

### [KO 400] Register — tournament is not open (IN_PREPARATION)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/{{closedTournamentId}}/registrations
Authorization: {{managerToken}}

### [KO 400] Register — TEAM_ALPHA has only 3 members (minimum 4 required)
## Run BEFORE the SETUP steps that add memberWithoutATeam2 to TEAM_ALPHA
POST {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/{{openTournamentId}}/registrations
Authorization: {{managerToken}}

## SETUP — add 4th member to TEAM_ALPHA before the [OK 201] test
### [SETUP] memberWithoutATeam2 joins TEAM_ALPHA
POST {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/1/membership
Authorization: {{memberWithoutATeam2}}

### [SETUP] Lynx accepts the join request (membership id depends on db state — adjust if needed)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/teams/memberships/3/accept
Authorization: {{managerToken}}

### [OK 201] Register — Lynx (manager of TEAM_ALPHA, 4 members) registers
## After this test: TEAM_ALPHA is registered to Spring Cup
POST {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/{{openTournamentId}}/registrations
Authorization: {{managerToken}}

### [KO 400] Register — Lynx tries to register TEAM_ALPHA again (already registered)
POST {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/{{openTournamentId}}/registrations
Authorization: {{managerToken}}

## GET /tournaments/{tournamentId}/registrations — List registered teams

### [OK 200] Get registrations — unauthenticated visitor sees TEAM_ALPHA registered
GET {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/{{openTournamentId}}/registrations
Accept: application/json

### [OK 200] Get registrations — authenticated user
GET {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/{{openTournamentId}}/registrations
Accept: application/json
Authorization: {{memberWithATeamToken}}

### [OK 200] Get registrations of closed tournament — empty list
GET {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/{{closedTournamentId}}/registrations
Accept: application/json

### [KO 404] Get registrations — tournament not found
GET {{baseUrl}}/tournaments/999999/registrations
Accept: application/json

## GET /tournaments — registrationsCount reflects registered teams

### [OK 200] List tournaments — registrationsCount for Spring Cup should be 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/tournaments
Accept: application/json

## GET /teams/{teamId}/registrations — List tournaments a team is registered for

### [OK 200] Get team activity — TEAM_ALPHA is registered to Spring Cup
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/1/registrations
Accept: application/json

### [OK 200] Get team activity — empty list for a team with no registrations
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/2/registrations
Accept: application/json

### [KO 404] Get team activity — team not found
GET {{baseUrl}}/teams/999999/registrations
Accept: application/json
